!!IF:M^{~Gold}%(name){~}

Reward: level 1, Attack 25, Defense 25, Power 25, Knowledge 25 and a matching commander.
%(specialty)

%(levelMark) Hero level: %(level)/25
%(partMark) Distinct matching parts: %(parts)/4 (assembled relic counts as eight)
%(townMark) Fully built owned town: %(missing) buildings missing
%(acceptMark) Champion quest started
%(winMark) Faction victories: %(wins)/5
%(trialMark) Resource reserves (kept):
Gold: %(gold)/200000
Wood: %(wood)/200; Ore: %(ore)/200
Mercury: %(mercury)/200; Sulfur: %(sulfur)/200
Crystal: %(crystal)/200; Gems: %(gems)/200

%(note)
Delivery: bound quest hero in the garrison (upper slot), empty visitor space (lower slot), fewer than eight heroes. Click Receive champion, then close the town screen.^;

